@startuml activity-plan-trip-part2-save
!include _style.iuml
title Plan Trip - Part 2: Save trip
|Traveller|
start
|React Client|
:Plan preview is displayed
(from Part 1);
|Traveller|
if (Save trip?) then (no)
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|React Client|
if (Logged in?) then (no)
  :Keep PlanInput in sessionStorage
  (stp.pendingPlan);
  |Traveller|
  :Login or register;
  |React Client|
  :Return to /plan and restore preview;
else (yes)
endif
:POST /trips (PlanInput + title)
Authorization: Bearer JWT;
|Express API|
:Verify JWT; regenerate itinerary + budget
(client numbers are never trusted);
|MongoDB / Providers|
:Insert trip document
(status = planned);
|Express API|
:201 { trip };
|React Client|
:Navigate to Trip Details (/trips/:id);
|Traveller|
:Review saved trip;
stop
@enduml
